                <opener><seg rendition="#center">No. 221.</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Becerra to Mr. Bayard</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Cape May, N. J.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1885-08-28"><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi> 28,
                        1885</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Peace in Colombia. Prestan hanged to-day in Colon.</p>
                <closer><signed>BECERRA.</signed></closer>
            </div>
